    <h2 style="margin-bottom:16px;">Meet the Owner</h2>
    <div class="card story-text">
      <p><strong>Hi, I’m Melody, the founder of Meli’s Prive.</strong> 🤍</p>
      <p>Meli’s Prive is a reflection of my love for beautiful things, creativity, elegance and the desire to build something of my own.</p>
      <p>I started this brand with a small beginning and a big vision. Along the way, I’ve learned that building a business is not always easy, but every order, every customer and every new step reminds me why I started.</p>
      <p>For me, Meli’s Prive is not simply about selling products. It’s about creating an experience where you can discover something beautiful, useful or special and feel confident choosing it for yourself or someone you love.</p>
      <p>I’m still growing, learning and building—and I’m so grateful to have you here as part of the journey.</p>
      <p><em>Welcome to Meli’s Prive.</em> ✨</p>
      <p style="color:var(--pink);font-weight:500;">Crafted for elegance, designed for you.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 style="margin:24px 0 14px;">Our Story</h2>
    <div class="card story-text">
      <p>Meli’s Prive was born from a simple desire: to create a brand where everyday things could feel a little more beautiful, thoughtful and personal.</p>
      <p>What started as a small dream has grown into a lifestyle brand built around discovering beautiful and useful pieces for the modern woman and her everyday life—from fragrances and jewellery to home essentials, décor, accessories and more.</p>
      <p>Behind Meli’s Prive is Melody, a young woman who believes that you don't have to wait until you have everything figured out before you start building the life you envision. This brand is part of that journey—a journey of growth, creativity, resilience and becoming.</p>
      <p>Every product is selected with the intention of bringing something special to our customers, whether it's a little elegance, convenience, comfort or simply something that makes you smile.</p>
      <p>Meli’s Prive is more than a store to me. It is a reminder that something beautiful can be built from a small beginning.</p>
    </div>
